CHANGELOG.md merge=union
# Lists that many branches add to, one name a line, in order: union keeps the lines both sides
# added instead of a conflict (CONTRIBUTING.md, "What branches don't edit by hand"). Only where
# each line of the list is whole by itself (a trailing comma on each) and nothing else in the file
# changes often. features.ts: a union that leaves its list out of order, or a name twice, fails the
# box's tests (test/features.test.ts) and `route-shapes.sh`. The update gate's lists: a name
# twice, or one missing from another, fails gpui's (kuvo_box/tests/vectors.rs); two names side by
# side in either order are fine.
box/src/shared/features.ts merge=union
protocol/gate-required.txt merge=union
